@host = http://localhost:5226

### 1. Simple question
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is FOIR?"
}

### 2. Chat with history
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "My monthly salary is ₹80,000." },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Noted. Your monthly salary is ₹80,000." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "My EMIs are ₹30,000. What is my FOIR?" }
  ]
}

### 3. Empty question (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

### 4. Strong applicant (expect Low risk)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "monthlyIncome": 120000,
  "existingEmis": 10000,
  "requestedLoanAmount": 500000,
  "tenureMonths": 36,
  "annualInterestRate": 12,
  "cibilScore": 790,
  "employmentType": "Salaried",
  "yearsInCurrentJob": 5
}

### 5. Risky applicant (expect High risk)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arun Kumar",
  "monthlyIncome": 45000,
  "existingEmis": 18000,
  "requestedLoanAmount": 400000,
  "tenureMonths": 24,
  "annualInterestRate": 14,
  "cibilScore": 640,
  "employmentType": "Self-employed",
  "yearsInCurrentJob": 1
}